"chim mới gần nhất ở hướng nào."

#. placeholders: {p}, {h}, {tab}
msgid ""
"On a trail, {p} names the birds nearest you, and {h} says which way the "
"nearest new bird is. Each trail ends at a landmark you can walk toward, or "
"press {tab} twice to head home. The birds follow the real seasons."
